Exceptions (inherit the upstream or stated license):

    mesa/*.patch, mesa/gallium-nvrm/, compiler/   (Mesa adaptation)
                              MIT (Mesa; see compiler/MESA-MIT.txt)
    vendor/nvidia/            MIT (NVIDIA open headers, notice in file)
    licenses/                 notices of ash (MIT/Apache-2.0), tinygrad (MIT)
                              and NVIDIA's public headers (MIT)
    src/vp9_tables.rs         values from libvpx (BSD-3-Clause, notice in file)
    src/video/vp8_init.bin    VP8 default probabilities of RFC 6386 (whose
                              reference code is BSD-3-Clause), laid out for
                              the decoder engine
    src/video/av1/cdf_defaults.rs
                              values from Mesa (MIT, AMD; notice in file)
    src/video/av1/testdata/   Big Buck Bunny (c) 2008 Blender Foundation,
                              CC-BY 3.0, re-encoded (see README.md there)

No NVIDIA binary is part of this directory. The backend talks to the host's
installed NVIDIA kernel module at runtime, unmodified.
